  "blockedAutomaticInterpretations": [
    "A quantitative result is not a labelling decision; the threshold and its decision rule belong to the regulation, not to this profile.",
    "No result is released without the expanded uncertainty attached.",
    "Clarify reporting at exactly the LOQ: data acceptance uses >= LOQ in 6.4.10.2.2, whereas 6.5.1 and 6.5.2 describe above and below LOQ.",
    "Do not apply a copy threshold to stored CalcConc without explicit copy units; percent content is not the stored concentration field.",
    "Laboratory approval is separate from automatic calculation. Missing method evidence produces a specific unresolved or repeat result; missing data never establish a GMO-negative sample."
